    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/fd325decd820bcdebdb9ff41d8b41d67.poster.avif?t=1740754871\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/fd325decd820bcdebdb9ff41d8b41d67.webm?t=1740754871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOFG! blends motion capture animations with real time physics. According to top goblin scientists, the simulation is 100% accurate when compared to real-world goblin physics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/64b87e3fb60af80db8a5f7dc40cba770.poster.avif?t=1740754871\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/64b87e3fb60af80db8a5f7dc40cba770.webm?t=1740754871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a ragdoll controller like no other! Take precise control of your goblin on land and while airborne! Aim your feet at the ground for a clean landing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/299c348ae094f809c8828c1886decf19.poster.avif?t=1740754871\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/299c348ae094f809c8828c1886decf19.webm?t=1740754871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>There is no feeling more heartwarming than throwing your friends down a mountain, and knowing they would do the same for you. Grab your best bud and experience WOFG! In splitscreen. Double the Goblins? Half the problems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/2caec698bb8140dbee34ed861d95e73d.poster.avif?t=1740754871\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/2caec698bb8140dbee34ed861d95e73d.webm?t=1740754871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>What the heck is up with all this sludge? Seems like a cataclysmic and plot-defining mystery.\u00a0<br>Do you have what it takes to uncover the truth and save Gobland? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/01687b73895213b65db886d8d807e6fc.poster.avif?t=1740754871\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/01687b73895213b65db886d8d807e6fc.webm?t=1740754871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/fd325decd820bcdebdb9ff41d8b41d67.poster.avif?t=1740754871\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/fd325decd820bcdebdb9ff41d8b41d67.webm?t=1740754871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOFG! blends motion capture animations with real time physics. According to top goblin scientists, the simulation is 100% accurate when compared to real-world goblin physics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/64b87e3fb60af80db8a5f7dc40cba770.poster.avif?t=1740754871\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/64b87e3fb60af80db8a5f7dc40cba770.webm?t=1740754871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a ragdoll controller like no other! Take precise control of your goblin on land and while airborne! Aim your feet at the ground for a clean landing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/299c348ae094f809c8828c1886decf19.poster.avif?t=1740754871\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/299c348ae094f809c8828c1886decf19.webm?t=1740754871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>There is no feeling more heartwarming than throwing your friends down a mountain, and knowing they would do the same for you. Grab your best bud and experience WOFG! In splitscreen. Double the Goblins? Half the problems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/2caec698bb8140dbee34ed861d95e73d.poster.avif?t=1740754871\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/2caec698bb8140dbee34ed861d95e73d.webm?t=1740754871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>What the heck is up with all this sludge? Seems like a cataclysmic and plot-defining mystery.\u00a0<br>Do you have what it takes to uncover the truth and save Gobland? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/01687b73895213b65db886d8d807e6fc.poster.avif?t=1740754871\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/01687b73895213b65db886d8d807e6fc.webm?t=1740754871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "The world's most accurate goblin simulation! Run and jump a ragdoll goblin through a hilarious physics adventure! Gobland is in trouble! Find the lost cogs, restore power, and become goblin royalty! Alone- or with a friend in split-screen, there's no stopping the BIG GOBLIN ENERGY!",
